    "I make Orbeon on my own, and someone choosing to chip in is what makes the next update worth writing. Premium is yours as well — consider it the least I can do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I make Orbeon on my own, and someone choosing to chip in is what makes the next update worth writing. Premium is yours as well — consider it the least I can do."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orbeon'u tek başıma yapıyorum. Senin gibi birinin destek olması, bir sonraki güncellemeyi yazmaya değdiğini hatırlatıyor. Premium'u da açtım, en azından bu kadarını yapayım."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache Orbeon allein, und dass jemand freiwillig etwas dalässt, ist der Grund, warum sich das nächste Update lohnt. Premium gehört jetzt auch dir — das Mindeste, was ich tun kann."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hago Orbeon yo solo, y que alguien decida aportar algo es lo que hace que valga la pena escribir la siguiente actualización. Premium también es tuyo: es lo mínimo que puedo hacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je fais Orbeon tout seul, et savoir que quelqu'un a choisi de participer, c'est ce qui donne envie d'écrire la prochaine mise à jour. Premium est à toi aussi, c'est la moindre des choses."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orbeonは一人で作っています。こうして支えてくれる人がいるから、次のアップデートを書く意味があります。プレミアムもお渡しします。せめてものお礼です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Personalize, under your characters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
