    "That code wasn't right, but here — 100 stars on the house!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Code war falsch, aber hier — 100 Sterne aufs Haus!"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese código no era correcto, pero toma — ¡100 estrellas de regalo!"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code n'était pas bon, mais tiens — 100 étoiles offertes !"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "そのコードは違いましたが、どうぞ — 100個の星をプレゼント！"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O kod doğru değildi ama al sana — 100 yıldız hediye!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That name is taken — pick another": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Name ist vergeben – wähle einen anderen"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese nombre ya está en uso — elige otro"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce nom est déjà pris — choisis-en un autre"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その名前は使われています。別の名前を選んでください"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu ad alınmış — başka bir tane seç"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ads are off from today. I make Orbeon on my own, and this goes straight into the next levels, characters and music.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The ads are off from today. I make Orbeon on my own, and this goes straight into the next levels, characters and music."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reklamlar bugünden itibaren kapalı. Orbeon'u tek başıma yapıyorum; bu destek doğrudan yeni bölümlere, karakterlere ve müziğe gidiyor."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ab heute keine Werbung mehr. Ich mache Orbeon allein, und das hier fließt direkt in die nächsten Level, Charaktere und die Musik."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los anuncios se acabaron desde hoy. Hago Orbeon yo solo, y esto va directo a los próximos niveles, personajes y la música."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fini les pubs à partir d'aujourd'hui. Je fais Orbeon tout seul, et ça part directement dans les prochains niveaux, les personnages et la musique."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日から広告はオフです。Orbeonは一人で作っていて、これは次のレベル・キャラクター・音楽にそのまま使わせてもらいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arc starts green: on your first lap it can't hurt you. The green melts away from both ends, and once it's gone the arc turns red and burns. Leave before that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The arc starts green: on your first lap it can't hurt you. The green melts away from both ends, and once it's gone the arc turns red and burns. Leave before that."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yay yeşil başlar: ilk turda sana bir şey olmaz. Yeşil iki ucundan erir, bittiği an yay kırmızıya döner ve yakar. Ondan önce oradan ayrıl."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Bogen startet grün: In der ersten Runde kann er dir nichts anhaben. Das Grün schmilzt von beiden Enden weg, und sobald es weg ist, wird der Bogen rot und brennt. Verschwinde vorher."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El arco empieza verde: en la primera vuelta no puede hacerte nada. El verde se consume por ambos extremos y, en cuanto se acaba, el arco se pone rojo y quema. Vete antes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'arc commence en vert : au premier tour il ne peut rien te faire. Le vert se consume par les deux bouts, et dès qu'il a disparu l'arc devient rouge et brûle. Pars avant."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "弧は緑から始まります。最初の1周は当たっても平気です。緑は両端から溶けていき、なくなった瞬間に赤くなって燃えます。その前に離れてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The champion orb cannot be bought — it is only won.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Champion-Kugel ist nicht käuflich – sie wird nur gewonnen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El orbe de campeón no se compra: solo se gana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'orbe du champion ne s'achète pas, il se gagne."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "チャンピオンオーブは購入できません。勝ち取るだけです。"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Şampiyon küresi satın alınamaz — yalnızca kazanılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first %lld levels are completely ad-free": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
